    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the cue stick to pot all the balls to clear the level. However, be careful\u2014if the cue ball falls into a pocket three times in a row, the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooting:</strong> Hold the left mouse button and use the &quot;Q&quot; and &quot;E&quot; keys to adjust the cue stick's direction. Release the left mouse button to strike the ball with the selected power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera View:</strong> Right-click to switch the camera view.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers two modes: <strong>Normal Mode</strong> and <strong>Crazy Mode</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode:</strong> The ball's movement follows real-world physics, such as bouncing off walls as expected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Mode:</strong> The ball's movement is unpredictable and may not behave as expected, creating unexpected challenges.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the cue stick to pot all the balls to clear the level. However, be careful\u2014if the cue ball falls into a pocket three times in a row, the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooting:</strong> Hold the left mouse button and use the &quot;Q&quot; and &quot;E&quot; keys to adjust the cue stick's direction. Release the left mouse button to strike the ball with the selected power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera View:</strong> Right-click to switch the camera view.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers two modes: <strong>Normal Mode</strong> and <strong>Crazy Mode</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode:</strong> The ball's movement follows real-world physics, such as bouncing off walls as expected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Mode:</strong> The ball's movement is unpredictable and may not behave as expected, creating unexpected challenges.</p></li></ul>",
